It's not too clear to me what he means by "stuck on a central
island".  If it's the central island with Medusa, then going on
down is definitely an option; a couple of the soldiers in the
castle generally have wands of code, and other options may show
up as well.  (For that matter, if he's not yet killed Medusa,
there's a 25% chance of levitation boots in her lair.)

